WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:08.208 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Tammy: YESTERDAY, JOE BIDEN

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.175 line:78%
STOOD BEFORE THE WORLD AND

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:11.177 line:78%
PROCLAIMED THAT THE TALIBAN'S

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:13.446 line:78%
TAKEOVER OF AFGHANISTAN CAME AS

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:16.016 line:78%
A TOTAL SURPRISE.

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:16.916 line:78%
THE ASSUMPTION WAS THAT MORE

00:00:16.116 --> 00:00:18.318 line:78%
THAN 300,000 AFGHAN NATIONAL

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:20.820 line:78%
SECURITY FORCES THAT WE HAD

00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:24.657 line:78%
TRAINED OVER THE PAST TWO

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:26.092 line:78%
DECADES AND EQUIPPED WOULD BE A

00:00:24.758 --> 00:00:29.596 line:78%
STRONG ADVERSARY IN THEIR CIVIL

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:31.765 line:78%
WARS WITH THE TALIBAN.

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:32.665 line:78%
THAT ASSUMPTION THAT THE AFGHAN

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:35.535 line:78%
GOVERNMENT WOULD BE ABLE TO HOLD

00:00:32.766 --> 00:00:36.870 line:78%
ON FOR A PERIOD OF TIME BEYOND

00:00:35.735 --> 00:00:38.538 line:78%
MILITARY DRAWDOWN TURNED OUT NOT

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:41.307 line:78%
TO BE ACCURATE.

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:41.741 line:78%
&gt;&gt; YEAH, WOW, THAT WAS AN

00:00:41.408 --> 00:00:44.477 line:78%
OBVIOUS LIE.

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:46.046 line:78%
HE SAID THE SAME THING TO

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:46.880 line:78%
STEPHANOPOULOS ON ABC.

00:00:46.146 --> 00:00:47.881 line:78%
ACCORDING TO REUTERS NOW.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.581 line:78%
YOU DON'T WANT TO MISS THIS AND

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:51.284 line:78%
IT'S TRUE.

00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:52.952 line:78%
IT'S NOT THE BABYLON BEE.

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:53.353 line:78%
BIDEN KNEW THAT THE COLLAPSE WAS

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:54.454 line:78%
INEVITABLE.

00:00:53.453 --> 00:00:56.056 line:78%
HE DIDN'T WANT ANYONE TOLLS KNOW

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:58.591 line:78%
ABOUT IT IN LATE JULY DURING A

00:00:56.156 --> 00:01:00.360 line:78%
PHONE CALL WITH PRESIDENT ASHRAF

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:02.529 line:78%
GHANI, BIDEN TOLD HIM TO PRETEND

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:04.397 line:78%
LIKE THE TALIBAN WASN'T READY TO

00:01:02.629 --> 00:01:07.333 line:78%
RETAKE THE COUNTRY, SAYING,

00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:08.068 line:78%
QUOTE:  I NEED NOT TELL YOU THE

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:09.869 line:78%
PERCEPTION AROUND THE WORLD AND

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:11.438 line:78%
IN PARTS OF AFGHANISTAN, I

00:01:09.969 --> 00:01:12.739 line:78%
BELIEVE, IS THAT THINGS AREN'T

00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:14.374 line:78%
GOING WELL IN TERMS OF THE FIGHT

00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:17.210 line:78%
AGAINST THE TALIBAN.

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:18.845 line:78%
AND THERE IS A NEED WHETHER IT'S

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:22.115 line:78%
TRUE OR OR NOT THERE IS A NEED

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:24.517 line:78%
TO PROJECT A DIFFERENT PICTURE.

00:01:22.215 --> 00:01:26.286 line:78%
JOINING ME NOW TO REACT IS

00:01:24.617 --> 00:01:28.321 line:78%
RETIRED ARMY INFANTRY CAPTAIN

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:30.223 line:78%
AND U.S. SENATE REPUBLICAN

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:33.493 line:78%
CANDIDATE SEAN PARNELL.

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:37.430 line:78%
SEAN, I THINK THAT THIS IS NOT

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:38.998 line:78%
LIKE GUESSWORK OR RHETORIC OR

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:40.400 line:78%
HYPERBOLE, THAT A CONFESSION, A

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:43.002 line:78%
RECOGNITION THAT THE COUNTRY WAS

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:44.037 line:78%
IN TROUBLE AND ASKING THE

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:46.506 line:78%
PRESIDENT OF AFGHANISTAN

00:01:44.137 --> 00:01:48.475 line:78%
EFFECTIVELY TO LIE ABOUT WHAT

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:50.910 line:78%
WAS GOING ON, WHICH MEANS ALSO,

00:01:48.575 --> 00:01:52.545 line:78%
YOU WILL NOT BE PREPARED BECAUSE

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:54.080 line:78%
YOU CAN'T PREPARE BECAUSE YOU'RE

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:54.614 line:78%
TELLING PEOPLE SOMETHING THAT'S

00:01:54.314 --> 00:01:56.816 line:78%
NOT TRUE.

00:01:54.714 --> 00:01:59.686 line:78%
WHAT ARE YOUR THOUGHTS ON THIS?

00:01:57.984 --> 00:02:00.453 line:78%
&gt;&gt; WELL, IT'S ABSOLUTELY

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:01.821 line:78%
UNBELIEVABLE, BUT NOBODY SHOULD

00:02:01.488 --> 00:02:03.056 line:78%
BE SURPRISED.

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:05.225 line:78%
JOE BIDEN HAS BEEN A POLITICIAN

00:02:03.223 --> 00:02:06.459 line:78%
IN WASHINGTON FOR 50 YEARS AND

00:02:05.325 --> 00:02:08.661 line:78%
LYING IS WHAT HE DOES.

00:02:06.893 --> 00:02:09.329 line:78%
HE SAID HE GRADUATED AT TOP OF

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:09.963 line:78%
HIS LAW SCHOOL.

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:12.765 line:78%
THAT WAS A LIE.

00:02:10.063 --> 00:02:13.399 line:78%
HE SAID HE HAD DEGREE THREE

00:02:12.866 --> 00:02:15.001 line:78%
DEGREES.  THAT WAS A LIE.

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:15.668 line:78%
HE SAID HE OPPOSED THE IRAQ WAR 

00:02:15.101 --> 00:02:17.203 line:78%
THAT WAS A LIE.

00:02:15.935 --> 00:02:19.939 line:78%
HE SAID HE WAS THE FIRST IN HIS

00:02:17.537 --> 00:02:21.341 line:78%
FAMILY TO GO TO COLLEGE IN A

00:02:20.039 --> 00:02:21.741 line:78%
THOUSAND GENERATIONS.  THAT WAS

00:02:21.508 --> 00:02:23.443 line:78%
A LIE.

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:25.111 line:78%
HE SAID HE WAS A COAL MINOR FROM

00:02:23.543 --> 00:02:25.378 line:78%
PENNSYLVANIA.  THAT WAS A LIE,

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:26.513 line:78%
TOO.

00:02:25.478 --> 00:02:28.148 line:78%
THAT'S WHAT THIS MAN DOES.

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:30.250 line:78%
FOR GOODNESS SAKE, HE SAID HE

00:02:28.248 --> 00:02:34.154 line:78%
WAS IN A KNIFE FIGHT WITH A GUY

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:34.687 line:78%
NAMED CORN POP.

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:35.955 line:78%
IT'S UNBELIEVABLE.

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:36.456 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Tammy: WHEN WE THINK BACK

00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:37.390 line:78%
IT'S UNBELIEVABLE.

00:02:36.556 --> 00:02:38.591 line:78%
LYING ABOUT YOURSELF, IT GIVES

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:40.226 line:78%
PEOPLE A HINT ABOUT YOUR

00:02:38.691 --> 00:02:43.163 line:78%
CHARACTER AND YOUR NATURE.

00:02:40.493 --> 00:02:45.431 line:78%
BUT, NOW THE LIES HAVE GOTTEN 13

00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:47.834 line:78%
OF OUR SERVICE MEMBERS MURDERED.

00:02:45.532 --> 00:02:49.469 line:78%
THOUGHT LIES UNTOLD NUMBERS OF

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:49.869 line:78%
PEOPLE IN AFGHANISTAN WILL BE

00:02:49.569 --> 00:02:52.038 line:78%
SLAUGHTERED.

00:02:49.969 --> 00:02:53.306 line:78%
THIS IS GOING TO BE A BLOODBATH.

00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:54.440 line:78%
THAT IS I THINK, WHAT THE

00:02:53.406 --> 00:02:55.875 line:78%
AMERICAN PEOPLE FOR SOME REASON

00:02:54.541 --> 00:02:57.310 line:78%
HAVE NOT MADE THE CONNECTION YET

00:02:55.975 --> 00:02:58.278 line:78%
WITH WHO THIS MAN IS.

00:02:57.410 --> 00:03:01.114 line:78%
&gt;&gt; THAT'S RIGHT.

00:02:58.378 --> 00:03:02.982 line:78%
AND HE DID THIS EXACT SAME THING

00:03:02.382 --> 00:03:04.851 line:78%
