00:03:04.951 --> 00:03:07.820 line:78%
INVESTIGATING MY FAMILY'S

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:09.389 line:78%
CORRUPT BUSINESS DEALINGS IN

00:03:07.921 --> 00:03:10.623 line:78%
YOUR COUNTRY OR YOU DON'T GET

00:03:09.489 --> 00:03:10.924 line:78%
THE BILLION DOLLARS.

00:03:10.723 --> 00:03:13.660 line:78%
RIGHT?

00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:14.894 line:78%
LIE ABOUT THE CONDITIONS ON THE

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:16.763 line:78%
BATTLEFIELD AND, OTHERWISE, YOU

00:03:14.994 --> 00:03:17.163 line:78%
WON'T GET THE MILITARY

00:03:16.863 --> 00:03:18.932 line:78%
ASSISTANCE.

00:03:17.263 --> 00:03:20.466 line:78%
THEY DON'T CALL HIM QUID PRO-JOE

00:03:19.032 --> 00:03:22.535 line:78%
FOR NOTHING.

00:03:20.567 --> 00:03:26.306 line:78%
AND THE MOST HORRIBLE THING

00:03:22.635 --> 00:03:27.707 line:78%
ABOUT ALL OF THIS, TAMMY, THE

00:03:26.406 --> 00:03:30.143 line:78%
FACT THAT HE HAD TO LIE MEANS

00:03:27.807 --> 00:03:32.145 line:78%
THAT HE KNEW SIX WEEKS AGO THAT

00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:32.845 line:78%
THINGS WERE GOING TO GO BAD.

00:03:32.312 --> 00:03:34.414 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Tammy: THAT'S CORRECT.

00:03:33.046 --> 00:03:34.881 line:78%
&gt;&gt; YET, HE DIDN'T ADDRESS THIS

00:03:34.614 --> 00:03:36.249 line:78%
STRATEGY.

00:03:34.981 --> 00:03:36.916 line:78%
HE DIDN'T WARN AMERICANS IN THAT

00:03:36.349 --> 00:03:40.253 line:78%
COUNTRY TO LEAVE.

00:03:37.016 --> 00:03:42.722 line:78%
HE DIDN'T TELL OUR MILITARY.

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:44.924 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Tammy: WE GOT RID OF BAGRAM.

00:03:42.822 --> 00:03:46.426 line:78%
ALL THE TERRORIST PRISONERS

00:03:45.024 --> 00:03:48.228 line:78%
BEING RELEASED IT'S ALMOST AS

